OL,3,A'Alice Cooper is a character, like
OL,4,AJekyll and Hyde'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRock legend Alice Cooper has opened up
OL,7,Fabout his redemption arc from the stage
OL,8,Fto the church ahead of a book tour pit
OL,9,Fstop in Wolverhampton.
OL,11,F"It's such a strange life that I had
OL,12,Fbecause I was the prodigal son. I grew
OL,13,Fup in a Christian church, went as far
OL,14,Faway as you can, then came back," he
OL,15,Ftold BBC Radio WM.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
