OL,3,A'Alice Cooper is a character, like
OL,4,AJekyll and Hyde'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the singer-songwriter
OL,7,Fpublished his autobiography, Devil on
OL,8,FMy Shoulder, earlier this month,
OL,9,Fdetailing the highs and lows of his
OL,10,Fnearly six-decade career that earned
OL,11,Fhim the title of the Godfather of Shock
OL,12,FRock.
OL,14,FHe is set to appear at the University
OL,15,Fof Wolverhampton at The Halls on
OL,16,FTuesday.
